            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "David Kozinski"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good recipe. I used a pestle after it was done cooking and smashed the beans up a bit not too much though and added a bit of Olive oil on top of each serving.",
            "datePublished": "2018-04-17T20:23:15.693Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
